    "h1": "Find Plants",
    "firstText": "Garden.io Ask garden Start HOME GARDEN Find Plants Choose plants that fit your beds. SUMMER 3 PLANTS FLOWER Calendula Flower Calendula officinalis BEST SPOT Its compact size makes it ideal for small spaces; plant in sunny spots for continual vibrant blooms. Consider growing alongside herbs and vegetables for extra appeal. LIGHT Full Sun To Light Shade. WATER Low An easy seasonal flower for edges, pollinator support, and steady cut-and-come-again blooms. ANNUAL Cilantro Herb Coriandrum sativum BEST SPOT Sow seeds outdoors in cool weather; thin seedlings for best growth. LIGHT Full Sun WATER Medium HEIGHT 12-24 in Cilantro (Coriandrum sativum) is an aromatic annual herb cultivated for its pungent leaves and seeds. ANNUAL Cucumber Vine Cucumis sativus BEST SPOT Use vertical supports to maximize space and improve fruit quality. LIGHT Full Sun WATER High HEIGHT 12-72 in Cucumber is a fast-growing annual vine cultivated for its crisp, edible fruits commonly used fresh or pickled.",
